  "body": "Positioned in one of Auckland’s most coveted coastal enclaves, this grand Brent Hulena-designed residence offers a refined blend of space, sophistication, and seclusion. Constructed in solid concrete and spanning approximately 423 sq m across three expansive levels with internal lift access, the home is a sanctuary of light, privacy, and effortless luxury.\r\n\r\nBordering a leafy reserve and surrounded by lush subtropical landscaping, the property enjoys a rare sense of shelter and serenity just moments from St Heliers village and beach. Filtered views extend to the harbour, and distant city skyline.\r\n\r\nDesigned to embrace its surroundings, vast sliding glass doors and walls of windows feature throughout, dissolving the boundary between indoors and out. Sunlight pours in from every aspect, illuminating interiors that are elegant and inviting. Multiple outdoor living areas offer options for entertaining or relaxation, including a private sheltered courtyard with a gas fire and a sun-soaked pool setting with water views.\r\n\r\nThe substantial home is thoughtfully configured for modern living and extended family or guest accommodation. The main level boasts two distinct living zones - one a refined formal lounge, the other an open-plan family and dining space anchored by a beautifully appointed designer kitchen. Premium appliances, a statement stone island, and warm timber finishes create a space that is as functional as it is visually striking.\r\n\r\nAccommodation is equally impressive, with four bedrooms and three beautifully appointed bathrooms on the upper level. The master suite is an expansive and luxurious retreat, complete with its own balcony, a walk-through wardrobe, and a sumptuous ensuite featuring a freestanding bath and dual vanities. Additional amenities include a powder room, wine cellar, full laundry, and internal access triple garaging.\r\n\r\nSecurely gated and privately walled, this beautiful home offers an exceptional coastal lifestyle defined by light, space, privacy and understated luxury. Call Greg now on +64 21 042 0966 for a private viewing.\r\n\r\nYou can view the e-book here: https://bit.ly/4d1xpGP\r\n\r\nImportant: This property may be marketed as suitable for overseas purchasers. However, this does not constitute confirmation of eligibility, approval, or suitability for any individual buyer. All overseas purchasers remain subject to New Zealand’s overseas investment laws, including the Overseas Investment Act 2005, and may require consent from the Overseas Investment Office. You must obtain your own independent legal, financial, and technical advice and secure any necessary approvals before proceeding with a purchase.",
